title: "AI Agents Make a Team's Mistakes. Give Them a Team's Rules."
description: "I moved a bike coalition off Salesforce with 17 Cloudflare Workers, mostly written by AI agents. The code was the easy part. Every rule that kept it safe has a dated incident behind it."
publishDate: "2026-11-03"
tags: [ai, cloudflare, nonprofits]
